CLASS:: MP2Clock
SUMMARY:: Generate or follow codec timing
CATEGORIES:: UGens>MPEG Audio
RELATED:: Guides/MPEGAudio, Classes/MP2Frames, Classes/MPEGFrame

DESCRIPTION::
Drive a patch from native codec timing or follow a stream sample by sample.

CLASSMETHODS::
METHOD:: ar
Use the first output as the zero-based frame row or MP3 granule row.

ARGUMENT:: marker
An MPEGFrame, its marker signal, or −2 to use the internal clock.

ARGUMENT:: downsample
Native clock divisor from 1 to 6. A reader samples this at start. Connected field streams preserve the original codec clock.

RETURNS:: Four audio signals in order: row, full-frame pulse, group or granule pulse, and numbered row marker.
